@jrm4 Love you, but bad take.

You can want to not be coddled, but also not want to be irrationally attacked. 

We don't need a pro crypto president or an anti-crypto army. We want to be left alone and not politicized at all.

@boonscap I mentioned chaos as a negative.

While I’d LOVE efficiency and I also don’t mind cutting aggressively, I don’t think I talked that extensively about DOGE itself. I may be misremembering.

You may be thinking of tariffs, which I view as one of the least-worst forms of taxation.
